1,2 $ Basidia mostly 2-spored
1,9 $ Basidia mostly 4-spored

2,3 $ Stipe distinctly radicant or directly connected to grass remnants
2,7 $ Stipe not radicant

3,0 $ Spores in average less than 10.0 x 6.0 µm, moderately thick-walled with small, often indistinct germ-pore; basidiocarp small, with pseudorhiza connected to grass remnants (31) $ Conocybe gracilis
