5,0 $ Pileus 3-15 mm wide with distinct, often acute papilla, ochraceous-stramineous; lamellae very distant, stipe white with up to 5 mm long pseudorhiza; spores in average 12.2-12.4 x 7.8-8.2 µm, not lentiform (36) $ Conocybe papillata
